      "stdout": "Manage draft projects (create / list / focus / ...).\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nSUBCOMMANDS:\r\n  create                      Create a new draft project\r\n  list                        List draft projects\r\n  focus                       Focus a draft project, so that the subsequent commands without\r\n                              `--ref` will use this project.\r\n  duplicate                   Duplicate a draft project\r\n  version                     Manage draft project version transitions\r\n  delete                      Delete a draft project\r\n  import                      Move an external draft project (created with `draft project\r\n                              create --dir`) back into the default Jianying/Capcut workspace.\r\n                              Auto-renames on name collision; PC only.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft project create --ref local://example\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft project create --ref local://example --dir ./outer\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n  Use `lyra-cli draft project <subcommand> --help` for more information.\r\n",
